  "description": "The CLASH ESSENTIAL plays the classy card with its matte paint finish.\n• FOX take care of the suspension with a 38 Float Performance fork. The super sensitive Float Evol spring and Grip hydraulic cartridge allows compression adjustment in three distinct positions. The FOX Float X2 Performance shock benefits from large air volume capacity ideal for long descents.\n• SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs offer a clear and powerful feel.\n• The DT SWISS E 532 rims and their wide profile are ideal for aggressive riding.\n• The SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain has efficient climbing capabilities. With wide 10-51 gearing, it’s perfect for rides with a lot of positive elevation gain.",
